---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms — VELORA EDIT" description="Terms of use for VELORA EDIT, an affiliate discovery platform." canonical="https://velora-edit.pages.dev/terms">
  <Header slot="header" /><Footer slot="footer" />
  <div class="wrap legal">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="rule"></span>Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms.</h1>
    <p class="muted">[Legal entity details to be configured before launch.]</p>
    <h2>What VELORA EDIT is</h2>
    <p>VELORA EDIT is an affiliate discovery publication. We curate and describe jewelry; we do not sell, fulfill, ship, or support the products. Purchases happen on AliExpress under that retailer's terms, pricing, shipping and returns policies.</p>
    <h2>What VELORA EDIT is not</h2>
    <p>We are not AliExpress, not an official AliExpress store, and not endorsed by AliExpress. Prices shown are indicative — the current price is always the one on the retailer's page.</p>
    <h2>Content</h2>
    <p>Editorial descriptions are our own concise summaries, not supplier copy. We show comparison prices and materials only when verified. We never publish fake reviews, ratings, sales counts, stock levels or discount claims.</p>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>No scraping that harms the service, no abuse of forms, no misrepresentation of our content as your own.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>.legal{max-width:760px;padding:48px 24px 72px}h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,68px)}h2{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:28px 0 8px}</style>
